  "id": "smooth-pursuit-eye-movement",
  "term": "smooth-pursuit eye movement",
  "definition": "Smooth-pursuit eye movement is one of the two main kinds of coordinated eye movement, alongside saccades. It refers to eye movement that follows a moving visual target and can interact with postural control during standing.",
