      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports that smooth pursuits are one of two types of efferent/conjugate eye movements alongside saccades, and that their effects may interact with postural control during standing (bipedal/unipedal).",
        "The packet does not state that smooth-pursuit eye movement “follows a moving visual target.”",
        "The packet does not support characterizing smooth pursuit as “coordinated.”"
